   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 510846881,
   "updated": 1789643193278,
   "text": "So home is asked to answer \u201cis this for me?\u201d and \u201cwhat should I do first?\u201d\nand the only vocabulary it has is a list of spaces.\n\nSymptom: people new(ish) get lost.   Root cause: the question they arrive with and the\nanswer the page can give are different kinds of thing.",
   "originalText": "So home is asked to answer \u201cis this for me?\u201d and \u201cwhat should I do first?\u201d\nand the only vocabulary it has is a list of spaces.\n\nSymptom: people new(ish) get lost.   Root cause: the question they arrive with and the\nanswer the page can give are different kinds of thing.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
