   "text": "Landing place for the concept \u00b7 guidance as you grow \u00b7 dashboard of your initiatives \u00b7\ndiscovery of new ones. Four jobs, one word \u2014 so every conversation about \u201cthe homepage\u201d is\nfour at cross purposes.",
