   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 552473781,
   "updated": 1789643193278,
   "text": "A per-account ledger of firsts \u2014 home, a space, a subspace, the forum, settings \u2014 that any\nsurface can query. Guidance becomes infrastructure rather than page furniture, on one global\nbudget: at most one ask live anywhere. That budget is what stops it becoming banner hell.",
   "originalText": "A per-account ledger of firsts \u2014 home, a space, a subspace, the forum, settings \u2014 that any\nsurface can query. Guidance becomes infrastructure rather than page furniture, on one global\nbudget: at most one ask live anywhere. That budget is what stops it becoming banner hell.",
