   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 298633061,
   "updated": 1789643193278,
   "text": "A new home isn't empty \u2014 it is other people's real work, honestly labelled as theirs, converting\nto yours as you act. Collapses \u201cshow me it's credible\u201d and \u201cgive me a starting point\u201d into a\nsingle mechanism instead of two competing blocks.",
   "originalText": "A new home isn't empty \u2014 it is other people's real work, honestly labelled as theirs, converting\nto yours as you act. Collapses \u201cshow me it's credible\u201d and \u201cgive me a starting point\u201d into a\nsingle mechanism instead of two competing blocks.",
