   "versionNonce": 836717919,
   "updated": 1789643193278,
   "text": "Every account already has a private space \u2014 not created, just there. \u201cCreate a space\u201d then\ndowngrades to \u201cinvite people in\u201d: much later, much smaller. The marathon becomes a walk, and a\nfirst contribution has somewhere safe to happen.",
   "originalText": "Every account already has a private space \u2014 not created, just there. \u201cCreate a space\u201d then\ndowngrades to \u201cinvite people in\u201d: much later, much smaller. The marathon becomes a walk, and a\nfirst contribution has somewhere safe to happen.",
